<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS3" title="In Appendix A Theory Details ‣ From Condensation to Rank Collapse: A Two-Stage Analysis of Transformer Training Dynamics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.3 </span>Theory details for Key-Query Dynamics</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS3.SSS1" title="In A.3 Theory details for Key-Query Dynamics ‣ Appendix A Theory Details ‣ From Condensation to Rank Collapse: A Two-Stage Analysis of Transformer Training Dynamics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.3.1 </span>Proof for Proposition <span class="ltx_ref"></span> under Assumption <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A Theory Details ‣ From Condensation to Rank Collapse: A Two-Stage Analysis of Transformer Training Dynamics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>Proof for Proposition <span class="ltx_ref"></span> under Assumption <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Theory Details ‣ From Condensation to Rank Collapse: A Two-Stage Analysis of Transformer Training Dynamics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5 </span>Proof for Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In From Condensation to Rank Collapse: A Two-Stage Analysis of Transformer Training Dynamics" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Experimental Details</span></a>
